					"nextDialogs": [
						750000607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000607,
					"content": "就用「派蒙应急小背包」里的这条丝巾稍微包扎一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000608,
					"content": "你的背包到底在哪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000609,
					"content": "哼，当然是藏在了不能随便被发现的地方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000610,
					"content": "欸呀，这丝巾你到底要不要用啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000611,
					"content": "要用的，谢谢派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000612
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000612,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小家伙？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000613,
					"content": "小家伙，不要动哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000614,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，{NICKNAME}，没想到它还挺乖的呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000615,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000616,
					"content": "这样就行了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000617,
					"content": "怎么样，小家伙，觉得好一些了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000618,
					"content": "呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000619,
					"content": "好了，小家伙看上去也很精神…真是松了口气，不过，你到底为什么被关进了那样一个罩子里呀？还有，还有那些兽境猎犬…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000620,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000621,
					"content": "你也不知道呀，就算你知道，你「呀啊呀啊」的我们也听不懂倒是了…不过，小家伙，我们把你救出来了，你可以回家啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000622,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000623,
					"content": "咦，难道不知道自己家在哪吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000624,
					"content": "那你的亲人，啊，难道，刚才的大家伙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000625,
					"content": "#那怎么办，{NICKNAME}…总不能把它一个人、呃一个家伙丢在这里吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000626,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000627,
					"content": "倒是可以先跟着我们…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000628,
					"content": "也是啦，说不定到了纳塔，就能找到小家伙的家人了…不过我们之前还没看到过跟小家伙一样的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000629,
					"content": "啊，「受龙…所选者…」，难道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000630,
					"content": "嗯…你说似乎看到了这样的话？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000631,
					"content": "这么说来，纳塔是龙的国度吧，咦，难道，小家伙也是…龙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000632,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000633,
					"content": "这么说来看上去确实和龙蜥挺像的，都有…两条腿和一条尾巴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000634,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000635,
					"content": "让它跟着我们是没问题啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000636
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000636,
					"content": "不过得问问它同不同意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000637,
					"content": "说的也是呢，小家伙，你愿意跟我们一起旅行吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000638,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000639,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000640,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，小家伙同意啦。对了，我是派蒙！{M#他}{F#她}是{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000641,
					"content": "啵嗯？呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000642,
					"content": "对了，小家伙也得有个名字…让我想想，看你颜色黄黄黑黑的，不如就叫你「土豆饼」吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000643,
					"content": "呜…呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000644,
						750000646
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000644,
					"content": "大概只能在猎鹿人受欢迎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000645
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000645,
					"content": "「在其他地方就不受欢迎」的意思是吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000647
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000647,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000648
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000648,
					"content": "#你想让{NICKNAME}给你取名字？这家伙的取名品味…我可不好说哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000649,
						750000650
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000649,
					"content": "明明我取的名字一向很正常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750000650,
					"content": "可怜的孩子…命中该有此劫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750000646,
					"content": "好像它不是很喜欢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000647
					]
				}
			]
		},
