					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000904,
					"content": "#看来它很喜欢这个名字呢…嘿嘿，希望在纳塔能够解开你身上的谜团…对了，还有{NICKNAME}突然就能够钻到龙身体里的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000905,
					"content": "#刚才都忘了问了，{NICKNAME}你突然就变成了龙，没出什么事吧，有没有觉得难受？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000906,
						750000908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000906,
					"content": "有点晕龙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000907,
					"content": "晕龙是什么啦！还有空开玩笑，下次不理你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000910,
					"content": "#不过，{NICKNAME}，我之前可没听说纳塔有人能够变成龙…感觉有点怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000911,
					"content": "真是的，才刚到纳塔，感觉就发生了这么多事…好了，接下来的问题就是，我们要怎么出去呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000912,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000913,
					"content": "嗯？你知道出去的地方吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750000908,
					"content": "我是龙，也不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000909
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750000909,
					"content": "最好是这样啦，要是哪天变成了龙的样子回不来，到时候可就麻烦了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750000910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
